                                "sense_id": "d4bfe607-1927-30fb-bf24-5ddf96318886",
                                "text": "Last Thursdayism is a response to omphalism which posits that, by the same logic, the world might have been created last Thursday (or, by implication, any given date and time), but with the appearance of age: people's memories, history books, fossils, light already on the way from distant stars, and so forth."
